 ADR 留在原 repo；引用上層版本，不能反向覆蓋。\n• 裁示、身分與行動許可各自核對；任務與驗收沿用原流程。\n• 判定保留原文與版本；含糊、衝突、無權或版本不明均不補猜。\n• ADR 沿用 dev2 格式與配號；實質變更新檔，小修保留原話及歷史。\u0000"}},"type":"geo","props":{"w":850,"h":160,"geo":"rectangle","dash":"draw","growY":0,"url":"","scale":1,"flipX":false,"flipY":false,"color":"orange","labelColor":"black","fill":"semi","size":"s","font":"draw","align":"start","verticalAlign":"start","richText":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 總指揮與工程決策的裁決者、來源及適用範圍分開。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 工程 ADR 留在原 repo；引用上層版本，不能反向覆蓋。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 裁示、身分與行動許可各自核對；任務與驗收沿用原流程。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 判定保留原文與版本；含糊、衝突、無權或版本不明均不補猜。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• ADR 沿用 dev2 格式與配號；實質變更新檔，小修保留原話及歷史。"}]}]}}},{"id":"shape:jm-P1-answer-S01-cli-p1-u26","typeName":"shape","x":550,"y":1878,"rotation":0,"index":"aRfPX","parentId":"page:jm-board-P1","isLocked":false,"opacity":1,"meta":{"journey":{"nodeId":"cli-p1-u26","kind":"answer","story":"S01","rendered":"Gap：可信binding指定repo身分，別名不合併；仍待驗。\u0000https://github.com/iamcxa/kc-claude-plugins/blob/docs/kc-decision-log-cli-map/docs/journey/kc-decision-log/p1-technical-contract.md#cli-p1-u26"}},"type":"note","props":{"color":"light-violet","size":"s","font":"draw","align":"middle","verticalAlign":"middle","labelColor":"black","growY":0,"fontSizeAdjustment":1,"url":"https://github.com/iamcxa/kc-claude-plugins/blob/docs/kc-decision-log-cli-map/docs/journey/kc-decision-log/p1-technical-contract.md#cli-p1-u26","scale":1,"textLastEditedBy":null,"richText":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Gap：可信binding指定repo身分，別名不合併；仍待驗。"}]}]}}},{"id":"page:jm-board-P1","typeName":"page","name":"P1（已選／Pilot）— 帶著精確裁示走完一次交接 — stories, flow & constraints","index":"a5","meta":{}},{"id":"shape:jm-P4b-release","typeName":"shape","x":320,"y":-224,"rotation":0,"in